@# Compiler/runtime fixture and authoring example for a multi-passage scene.

:: example.passage-scene -> @exit
@heading "A short scene"
@onenter
  @effect add story.examples.passageSceneEntries 1
@endonenter

The first passage is displayed without requiring a standalone scene.

@next

@passage decision

The second passage can offer ordinary authored choices.

@choice stay "Read this passage again" -> .decision
@endchoice

@choice finish "Continue to the ending" -> .ending
  @effect set story.examples.passageSceneFinished true
@endchoice

@passage ending

The final passage returns to the underlying world hub.

@next "Return"
